$10$ | $8$ |\n| $15$ | $12$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following ordered pairs: $(5,4),$ $(10,8),$ $(15,12).$\n\nPlotting these points on the coordinate plane, we get:\n\n![](images/d4/d4bf54ac87bed89a5384359136feb1e5e0e090f6f7065b48ea99915f4fafdfb0.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186455438 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073883 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a1c72ed5-ab55-5815-b0a2-9a88eb15d362" :knowledge-point/title "Graphing Ratios"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "001a8d81-f5d9-5566-a1e8-0eda0971e84c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5f/5f3d4d4fa41ab9f8f4403189e6e032ed6c28be107fb0730c19a6c388e293007b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454903} {:answer/id #uuid "1c57d50f-49fb-5a5c-a956-799c84c63dd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a2/a2fdb375ad24c522070f83eb5909a77340931466ab4c575dbbfac1246f6eaab8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454947} {:answer/id #uuid "3b95188c-80c5-5680-b1bb-4b77ee8b29ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/67/67a63fc01a35a6f1a91153e25383b84d8b320c6c09eab2194ee39cd570ed799f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455002} {:answer/id #uuid "402fba0c-aa73-5e8a-b5d3-77b9642c6934" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/6a/6a5d172ff94df18a8c50874a5facc83e67aa91fa6023370406f824d7320331f6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455011} {:answer/id #uuid "6305a3b7-226b-53b1-8bd9-6364cfeaa024" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8f/8feba19e693f7a89c80722f9543b61880cb7cb0cb92e634b86599343086c318f.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186455080}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b95188c-80c5-5680-b1bb-4b77ee8b29ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/67/67a63fc01a